WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
And here in the United States, four years of weakness,

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:07.040
lawlessness, and radicalism under the last administration

00:00:07.760 --> 00:00:12.800
delivered our nation into a repeated set of disasters.

00:00:13.680 --> 00:00:16.559
One year ago, our country was in deep trouble.

00:00:17.440 --> 00:00:20.320
But today, just eight months into my administration,

00:00:21.280 --> 00:00:23.440
we are the hottest country anywhere in the world.

